authors:
- family-names: Allzén
  given-names: Simon
  affiliation: Stockholm University; University of Amsterdam
abstract: Reproduction bundle for Diverging paths to dark-matter discovery, version
  3.1.0. Adds a shared script/notebook route, exact frozen inputs with lossless restoration,
  conditional reconstruction of 57 network graph/window combinations, approved stepwise
  main-figure presentation, and bundled STIX typography. Corpus, candidate products,
  bootstrap/sensitivity outputs and historical network archives retain their v3.0.0
  scientific identities. The analysis cutoff is 2025. No new retrieval, classification
  validation, annotation or bootstrap resampling is claimed. Current raw-abstract
  extraction is not asserted to recreate historical network event tables. Manuscript
  text and the preprint remain separate.
keywords:
